sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Customer
    participant R as Restaurant
    participant O as Order
    participant OI as OrderItem

    Note over O: Order is in CREATED status

    activate C
    C->>O: addItem(item, quantity)
    activate O
    O->>R: getItems()
    activate R
    R-->>O: list[Item]
    deactivate R

    alt item belongs to the order's restaurant
        O->>OI: new OrderItem(item, quantity, unitPrice = item.price)
        activate OI
        OI-->>O: orderItem
        deactivate OI
        O->>O: totalPrice += quantity * unitPrice
        O-->>C: None
    else item belongs to another restaurant
        O-->>C: error: item not available in this restaurant
    end
    deactivate O
    deactivate C